        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Chalmers' 1995 paper \"Facing Up to the Problem of Consciousness\" named a distinction that was implicit in many earlier debates. The \"hard problem\" is not just a *harder* version of the easy problems — it is conceptually different in kind."
